  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The magical power that runs through your veins is beyond compare.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Greater Eldritch Heritage<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain sorcerer bloodline powers of the bloodline tied to Eldritch Heritage as if your sorcerer level were equal to your character level, and you use your full character level to determine the effects of your bloodline powers.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
